Coverage limits:
- Did not inject pool exhaustion, free-list capacity exhaustion, overlapping free, or bridge reservation failure.
- Available QEMU devices expose no prefetchable BAR, so the prefetch window path was not exercised in this phase.
- Reservations account for currently free space; they do not relocate BARs allocated before a bridge window is known.
